+| M0 negative suite | exit 0; 32/32 | `.temp/TASK-260715-3ejhyy/m0-bindings-test-rework-01.log` |
+| Native/libssh2 pins and linkage | exit 0 | `.temp/TASK-260715-3ejhyy/check-native-dependencies-rework-01.log` |
+| Strict recursive Swift format | exit 0 | `.temp/TASK-260715-3ejhyy/swift-format-lint-rework-final.log` |
+| `git diff --check` | exit 0 | `.temp/TASK-260715-3ejhyy/git-diff-check-rework-final.log` |
+| Board validation | process exit 0; one reported parent aggregate mismatch | `.temp/TASK-260715-3ejhyy/task-board-validate-rework-final.log` |
+
+## Negative evidence and production call site
+
+- `MacOSProductionDependencyFactory.makeRuntime()` refuses absent, unreadable,
+  digest-drifted, permission-disabled, superseded, pin-drifted,
+  capability-incomplete, and incompatible binding input before component
+  construction or routes.
+- `semanticIntegerTypes` narrows integer fields to booleans, fractions, and
+  overflow values and requires semantic refusal.
+- `exactGraphLifecycle` proves the composed host-policy and credential paths are
+  called, and that packet ownership events cannot occur before settings apply.
+- `scripts/check-core-boundaries.sh` rejects a narrowed public factory surface
+  that exposes `makeSSHBootstrap`, selected transport, credential provider,
+  host-policy factory, or diagnostic mapper overrides; it also requires the
+  mandatory calls to remain in the production entry point.
+- `dnsOnlyUDPDispatch` admits virtual-DNS TCP/UDP and requires ordinary UDP to
+  fail with `generalUDPDeferred`.
+
+## Preserved failures and anomalies
+
+- Rework compile attempts 01–03 exited 1 while the new Core/native imports,
+  UUID/string validation, and test factory API were being corrected. Logs are
+  retained under `.temp/TASK-260715-3ejhyy/`.
+- The first rework strict lint exited 1 on mechanical formatting and the final
+  recursive lint exits 0.
+- One attempted multi-item board checklist mutation exited 1 because task-board
+  permits one checklist activity per mutation. The five atomic mutations then
+  exited 0.
+- `task-board validate` returned process exit 0 while reporting the owning Story
+  stored as `to-dev` versus its child aggregate `development`. This parent state
+  is orchestrator-owned and is recorded as an issue, not described as clean.
+- No live Keychain lookup, SSH network connection, provider launch, VPN start,
+  route/DNS mutation, or PacketFlow/HEV runtime was performed by the deterministic
+  ownership tests. The provider matrix was build/validation only.
+
+## Review focus
+
+- `MacOSProductionDependencyFactory.makeRuntime()` and its public component
+  factory surface for the eliminated SSH bypass.
+- `MacOSProductionSSHBootstrap` for immutable profile/security dependency order.
+- `M1HEVSOCKSConnectionAdapter`, `BridgeBackedM1PacketPlaneSession.activateReads`,
+  and the exact production/harness ownership tests for preflight and teardown.
